{"kind":"pr","url":"https://github.com/BEDOLAGA-DEV/remnawave-bedolaga-telegram-bot/pull/2948","repo":"BEDOLAGA-DEV/remnawave-bedolaga-telegram-bot","number":2948,"set":"agent","source":"claude-code-open","title":"feat: Apple Sign In, Google Sign in and account self detection","body":"## Overview\r\n\r\nЭтот PR добавляет поддержку мобильной авторизации и управления аккаунтом для Cabinet:\r\n\r\n- Sign in with Apple для web и native iOS сценариев.\r\n- Native Google Sign-In для мобильных клиентов.\r\n- Привязку Apple/Google аккаунтов и merge flow при конфликте аккаунтов.\r\n- Безопасное удаление аккаунта с OAuth revocation proof flow.\r\n- Apple IAP balance top-up hardening: строгий payload, backend-owned product mapping, App Store verification, webhook handling и sandbox режим для App Review/TestFlight.\r\n\r\n## New environment variables\r\n\r\n### Apple Sign-In\r\n\r\n```env\r\nOAUTH_APPLE_ENABLED=true\r\nOAUTH_APPLE_WEB_CLIENT_ID=\r\nOAUTH_APPLE_IOS_CLIENT_ID=\r\nOAUTH_APPLE_TEAM_ID=\r\nOAUTH_APPLE_KEY_ID=\r\nOAUTH_APPLE_PRIVATE_KEY_PATH=\r\n```\r\n\r\nOAUTH_APPLE_WEB_CLIENT_ID используется для web OAuth flow, а OAUTH_APPLE_IOS_CLIENT_ID для native iOS Sign in with Apple.\r\n\r\n### Apple IAP\r\n\r\nновый параметр\r\n```env\r\nAPPLE_IAP_CREDIT_SANDBOX_ON_PRODUCTION=false\r\n```\r\n\r\nAPPLE_IAP_CREDIT_SANDBOX_ON_PRODUCTION нужен только временно для App Review/TestFlight, когда production backend должен зачислять verified sandbox purchases. После проверки его нужно выключить.","authorType":"User","additions":7091,"deletions":165,"changedFiles":61,"files":[{"path":".env.example","additions":28,"deletions":0},{"path":"CHANGELOG.md","additions":6,"deletions":0},{"path":"app/cabinet/apple_iap.py","additions":28,"deletions":4},{"path":"app/cabinet/auth/oauth_providers.py","additions":561,"deletions":2},{"path":"app/cabinet/auth/oauth_revocation_proofs.py","additions":53,"deletions":0},{"path":"app/cabinet/routes/account_linking.py","additions":430,"deletions":16},{"pat